{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":13869.426318000002,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":14304.064753999999,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":14356.372460999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14357.851837999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14359.085205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14360.818133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":14362.615488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14364.269088000001,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":20809.907755,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21302.71443,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21360.238538999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21361.446397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21363.223312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21365.031653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21366.809359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21368.580005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21369.597676999998,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":32136.546932999998,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen."},{"kind":"text","t":32355.816531999997,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons."},{"kind":"audio","t":32402.143105999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":32403.400639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32405.062359999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32405.926,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":32930.215083999996,"text":"die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":33105.130618999996,"text":"ranging from neglect to abuse to extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33148.252769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33150.236235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33150.713192999996,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":42760.514995,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":43276.072646,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43336.163719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":43337.447460999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43339.113468999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43341.093249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43342.690093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43344.452095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":43346.26886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43348.069429999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43349.380113,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":54952.330383,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":55230.443087,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":55277.721213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55279.213879999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55280.868901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55282.57589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55283.869628,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":58067.628133,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":58356.592040999996,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58404.786245999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58406.295598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58408.137761,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58408.285673,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58450.234247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58451.63125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58453.387293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58454.179025,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":70319.71371899999,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70748.567075,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":70798.14739299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70799.748859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70801.433981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70803.158513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70804.925759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70806.301414,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":72314.073535,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72517.109769,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72561.15723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72562.559306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72564.047911,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":84790.83156,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":85040.34509,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":85084.817142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":85086.446239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85088.109669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":85088.232584,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":85118.848752,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85120.614116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":85120.758143,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94667.733747,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":95006.51465699999,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95055.48155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95056.899339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95058.604601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95060.419509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":95060.571268,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95094.464039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95096.23357899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95098.01099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95099.299144,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100648.771645,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100911.924141,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100957.316471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100959.083136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":100960.753806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100962.50590999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":100962.664259,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113025.678953,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":113401.26480799999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":113449.660649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113451.365311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113453.029171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":113454.982147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":113456.771747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":113457.037197,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118860.669461,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":119257.331502,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":119311.690069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":119313.269551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119315.035015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119316.760778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119318.521525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119320.330434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119322.252874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":119322.394197,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129389.667561,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129959.333139,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":130014.93817499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130016.413631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130018.141718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130019.900822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130021.724193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130023.606432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130025.38272200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130026.41271599999,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":141742.277073,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142168.074368,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that Nepal’s UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142224.97534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142226.372348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":142228.090429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142229.862363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":142231.709379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142233.524698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":142235.274027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":142237.078219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142239.004204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":142239.149063,"samples":6888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":153450.729619,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland. Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam."},{"kind":"text","t":153790.912935,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. He also attacked everything that went into the water."},{"kind":"audio","t":153840.16657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153841.420542,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":153843.157622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153845.069216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153846.210608,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":153878.666842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":153880.129719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153881.332634,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":156018.106558,"text":"Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":156297.481077,"text":"Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":156343.678912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156345.373629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156346.829625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156347.405534,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":168515.995942,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":168949.910573,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":169004.266906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169006.091939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169007.883903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169009.675726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169011.364083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169013.170167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169014.953768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169015.58160499998,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":176426.925228,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":176762.29261899999,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176811.178369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176813.02894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":176814.873032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176816.612276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176818.232541,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":188999.021149,"text":"es gibt familienstrände die manchmal überlaufen sind mit einer schönen einkaufspromenade entlang der küste das schwimmen ist hier sicher die meisten der kleineren inseln"},{"kind":"text","t":189483.771472,"text":"There are family beaches that can sometimes be crowded, with a nice shopping promenade along the coast. Swimming here is safe; most of the smaller islands"},{"kind":"audio","t":189532.392232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189534.003693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189535.620552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189537.410412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189539.276708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":189539.406394,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":189569.884433,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189570.241301,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"audio","t":189602.640349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189603.598925,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":198305.064959,"text":"unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":198532.424617,"text":"Independent nations or part of France, known as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":198576.733572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":198578.40234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":198580.108354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":198581.931254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":198582.062492,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":208603.296751,"code":1005}]}